8. USEFUL RUFF COMMANDS
============================================================

You can also use Ruff directly from the terminal.

8.1 Install Ruff

Command:

    pip install ruff

8.2 Check Code for Linting Issues

Command:

    ruff check .

Purpose:

Checks Python files in the current project directory and reports linting issues.

8.3 Automatically Fix Supported Issues

Command:

    ruff check . --fix

Purpose:

Automatically fixes supported linting issues, such as unused imports.

NOTE:
Not every linting issue can be fixed automatically.

8.4 Format Python Code

Command:

    ruff format .

Purpose:

Formats Python files in the current project directory.

8.5 Check Formatting Without Changing Files

Command:

    ruff format --check .

Purpose:

Checks whether files already follow Ruff's formatting rules without modifying them.

